        <Param val="In this task you need to identify the emotion of the person in the image while ignoring the emotion word that is written on the screen. &amp;#10;&amp;#10;You will use the f and h keys on the keyboard to indicate what emotion the face is showing.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Remember, ignore the word; press:&amp;#10;f for fearful FACES&amp;#10;h for happy FACES&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Press any key to continue" valType="str" updates="constant" name="text"/>
